description=Survival Tabs have a long history. In the ’60s the Federal Government was searching for a food source that could be used in specialty situations. The objective was to invent a product that would provide the best possible nutrition in the smallest possible volume. The resulting research was extremely involved and intense, and the product that evolved was used in the early space program. Eventually, a tablet was perfected and used widely as an emergency food. Professional athletes began using The Survival Tabs to maintain their ideal weight while sustaining maximum levels of activity and strength. A number of entertainers began using The Survival Tabs for the same reason. Dieters also discovered that they could lose weight very comfortably by replacing meals and snacks with The Survival Tabs.
